<title>ITALY: Italy to offer new BTP, CCT, CTZ issues in Q3.</title>
<headline>Italy to offer new BTP, CCT, CTZ issues in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury said on Friday it would offer the following new issues in the third quarter:</p>
<p>* 10-year  1-7-97  BTP, minimum amount 10 trillion lire</p>
<p>*  7-year  1-9-97  CCT, minimum amount 10 trillion lire</p>
<p>* 24-month 15-7-97 CTZ, minimum amount  7 trillion lire</p>
<p>* 18-month 15-9-97 CTZ, minimum amount  7 trillion lire</p>
<p>The Treasury said in a statement it also reserved the right to offer other issues during the quarter.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
